      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0090_select_01",
      "hash64": "0FF599EC3ADB8C46",
      "text": "C’est bien bleu !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0090_select_02",
      "hash64": "0FF598EC3ADB8A93",
      "text": "C’est super moderne !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0090_select_03",
      "hash64": "0FF597EC3ADB88E0",
      "text": "Je ne vois pas trop de différence !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0090_sister_04",
      "hash64": "81BEC80927107C61",
      "text": "Normal, c’est la couleur officielle de l’institut !\\nIls sont allés loin avec leur concept de myrtille...\\c\\nFaudra que tu viennes voir ma chambre aussi,\\nune prochaine fois ![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 173,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0090_sister_05",
      "hash64": "81BEC70927107AAE",
      "text": "Hé hé, c’est vrai qu’on est à la pointe\\nde la technologie, ici !\\c\\nFaudra que tu viennes voir ma chambre aussi,\\nune prochaine fois ![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0090_sister_06",
      "hash64": "81BEC609271078FB",
      "text": "Genre !\\nArrête les vannes !\\c\\nEn tout cas, faudra que tu viennes voir\\nma chambre aussi, une prochaine fois ![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
